// ── Finance (Phase 4) ──
// Money is INTEGER HALALAS (docs/02 §4). Columns are Int; app-layer Zod guards
// reject amounts above the int4 ceiling (~21.4M SAR/amount) and Postgres errors
// loudly on overflow — no silent corruption. Upgrade to BigInt if large-award
// handling is needed.

